#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"No matching flag found for \"%s\"; press Enter to add it as a custom flag."
msgstr ""
"Níor aimsíodh aon bhratach chomhoiriúnach do \"%s\"; brúigh Iontráil chun í "
"a chur leis mar bhratach saincheaptha."

msgid "Image Pasted!"
msgstr "Íomhá Greamaithe!"

msgid "Press Ctrl+V or Command+V to paste an image."
msgstr "Brúigh Ctrl+V nó Command+V chun íomhá a ghreamú."

msgid "No image found in clipboard"
msgstr "Níor aimsíodh aon íomhá sa ghearrthaisce"

msgid ""
"A pull or merge request will be created from a branch in the repository."
msgstr "Cruthófar iarratas tarraingthe nó cumaisc ó bhrainse sa stórlann."

msgid ""
"A push URL is set but no push branch is given. Set a push branch that "
"differs from the translated branch."
msgstr ""
"Socraítear URL brú ach níl aon bhrainse brú tugtha. Socraigh brainse brú atá "
"difriúil ón mbrainse aistrithe."

msgid ""
"The push branch must differ from the translated branch when creating a pull "
"or merge request."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór don bhrainse brú a bheith difriúil ón mbrainse aistrithe agus "
"iarratas tarraingthe nó cumaisc á chruthú."

msgid "A pull or merge request will be created from a fork of the repository."
msgstr "Cruthófar iarratas tarraingthe nó cumasc ó fhorc den stórlann."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"A pull or merge request will be created from the “%s” branch in the "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"Cruthófar iarratas tarraingthe nó cumaiscthe ón mbrainse “%s” sa stórlann."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Changes will be sent as a Gerrit review request targeting the “%s” branch."
msgstr ""
"Seolfar athruithe mar iarratas athbhreithnithe Gerrit ag díriú ar an "
"mbrainse “%s”."

msgid "Changes will be sent as a Gerrit review request."
msgstr "Seolfar athruithe mar iarratas athbhreithnithe Gerrit."

msgid ""
"Changes will not be pushed automatically. You can still push them manually "
"from the repository maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuirfear athruithe ar fáil go huathoibríoch. Is féidir leat iad a chur "
"ar fáil de láimh fós ón gcothabháil stórais."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Changes will be pushed directly to the “%s” branch in the push repository."
msgstr "Brúfar athruithe go díreach chuig an mbrainse “%s” sa stór brú."

msgid ""
"Changes will be pushed directly to the default branch of the push repository."
msgstr ""
"Brúfar athruithe go díreach chuig an mbrainse réamhshocraithe den stór brú."

msgid "Text copied to clipboard."
msgstr "Cóipeáladh an téacs chuig an ngearrthaisce."

msgid "Error copying to clipboard."
msgstr "Earráid ag cóipeáil chuig an ghearrthaisce."

msgid "Some source strings could not be assigned."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir roinnt teaghráin foinse a shannadh."

msgid "Error loading search results!"
msgstr "Tharla earráid ag lódáil torthaí an chuardaigh!"

msgid "No new matching source strings found."
msgstr "Níor aimsíodh aon teaghráin nua foinse chomhoiriúnaithe."

msgid "Sort this column"
msgstr "Sórtáil an colún seo"

msgid "Error while loading page:"
msgstr "Tharla earráid ag lódáil an leathanaigh:"

msgid "Please press Ctrl+C to copy."
msgstr "Brúigh Ctrl+C le cóipeáil."

msgid "Search…"
msgstr "Cuardaigh…"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "Á lódáil…"

msgid "Error while loading form:"
msgstr "Earráid agus an fhoirm á luchtú:"

msgid "Weblate is now scanning the repository, please be patient."
msgstr "Tá Weblate ag scanadh na taisclainne. Bí foighneach, le do thoil."

msgid ""
"Notification settings removed, please do not forget to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"Baineadh na socruithe fógra, le do thoil ná déan dearmad na hathruithe a "
"shábháil."

msgctxt "Alert to user when opening browser developer console"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Stad!"

msgid ""
"This is a browser feature intended for developers. If someone told you to "
"copy-paste something here, they are likely trying to compromise your Weblate "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Is gné bhrabhsálaí é seo atá beartaithe d'fhorbróirí. Má dúirt duine leat "
"rudaí a chóipeáil agus a ghreamú anseo, tá seans maith go bhfuil siad ag "
"iarraidh do chuntas Weblate a shárú."

msgid "See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS for more information."
msgstr ""
"Féach ar https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais."

